      <h2 id="virt-using-virt-must-gather_virt-collecting-virt-data" class="group scroll-mt-20">Using the must-gather tool for OpenShift Virtualization<a href="#virt-using-virt-must-gather_virt-collecting-virt-data" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">You can collect data about OpenShift Virtualization resources by running the <code>must-gather</code> command with the OpenShift Virtualization image.</p>
